# An Analysis of Search Terminology Used by Humanities Scholars: The Getty Online Searching Project Report Number 1.

**Authors:** Bates, Marcia J., And Others

## Abstract
Reports a study that analyzed natural language search statements constructed by 22 Getty Visiting Scholars as they researched humanities topics on DIALOG. Results show a greater use of names, geographical areas, chronological periods, and discipline terms than scientists use, with implications for the design of humanities online systems and thesauri. (41 references) (EA)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ459881

